type: software
title: IMU Gesture Classifier
abstract: >-
  Two-stage recognition of fifteen hand gestures from smartwatch accelerometer
  and gyroscope data: a binary entry detector over a sliding window, followed by
  a fifteen-class model over the buffer the detection opens.
